{"version":1,"content":"<p>加州理工學院的研究人員用激光照射一塊晶體，觀察到數十億個原子整齊劃一地發射微波和紅外光脈衝。這項研究揭示了原子如何通過一種名為超輻射的量子現象實現同步，並據此製造出一種能同時輸出微波和光信號的頻率梳。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1588318.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T08:03:53.306579+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T07:44:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T07:57:15.485452+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T07:57:15.485452+00:00","content_hash":"ec12a86c6a3b91cfc582b82788cccac089c31e702a70ca10dde1b856c58ba93a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}